    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@value": "We are excited to bring this wonderful Christmas tradition back to the John Walter Museum and Muttart Conservatory this year. Candlelight Christmas at the John Walter Museum includes two 45 minute musical performances from the McDades, who have been a part of this special event for over 20 years. Performances will take place in the two oldest John Walter houses. There will be an intermission with seasonal, family friendly beverages in our Visitor Centre."
